# eOn SVN r2549. HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel ljcluster.
# Lowest mode of the 200 LJ38 geometries, same protocol as eon/develop-low-lj38-dimer. Saddle Search max_iterations is 0. Improved dimer, rotation conjugate gradient, converged_angle 0. The harness raises rotations_max from 1 and keeps the first run whose absolute overlap with the reference mode is at least 0.99. The recorded calls are that run. Potential ljcluster. direction.dat is the numpy seed 314159 mode. client_displace_type load. Main random_seed is 1. The run swaps the potential for ext_pot. The harness kernel is the develop kernel for this potential name. The 2014 table used r2156. The binary is SVN r2549, the registry pin. Export of the 2014 revision is forbidden, so this row is r2549.
counter harness
code Eon svn
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm Dimer
tuning default
template eon-svn/low-lj38-dimer
problem lowest-eigenvector/lj38
reducer harness
cap 10000
n 400
par2_mean 30.355
nfailed 0
mean_calls 30.355
median_calls 29.0
min_calls 14.0
max_calls 81.0
n_crash 0
n_divergence 0
n_cap 0
n_wrong_stationary 0
